1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:11,427
Speaking, task one. Topic 18: Health and the doctor. Ten questions. Listen to the question and answer aloud.

2
00:00:12,133 --> 00:00:13,379
How do you feel?

3
00:00:18,767 --> 00:00:21,320
Today I feel fine, nothing hurts.

4
00:00:22,233 --> 00:00:23,960
Do you have a GP?

5
00:00:29,367 --> 00:00:32,065
Yes, I have a GP near my home.

6
00:00:32,967 --> 00:00:34,694
How often do you go to the doctor?

7
00:00:40,100 --> 00:00:42,410
I go to the doctor once a year for a check-up.

8
00:00:43,300 --> 00:00:44,892
What do you do when you are ill?

9
00:00:50,300 --> 00:00:53,661
When I'm ill I stay at home, drink tea and take medicine.

10
00:00:54,567 --> 00:00:56,243
Do you have health insurance?

11
00:01:01,633 --> 00:01:04,676
Yes, I'm insured with VZP.

12
00:01:05,567 --> 00:01:07,445
When were you last ill?

13
00:01:12,833 --> 00:01:16,027
I was last ill in winter, I had the flu.

14
00:01:16,933 --> 00:01:18,283
What did the doctor tell you?

15
00:01:23,667 --> 00:01:27,336
The doctor said I had to stay at home for a week and take antibiotics.

16
00:01:28,233 --> 00:01:29,788
Have you ever been in hospital?

17
00:01:35,200 --> 00:01:39,699
Yes, a year ago I was in hospital because I had a broken arm.

18
00:01:40,600 --> 00:01:42,009
When will you go to the dentist?

19
00:01:47,400 --> 00:01:49,585
I'll go to the dentist next month for a check-up.

20
00:01:50,500 --> 00:01:52,185
What would you do for your health?

21
00:01:57,600 --> 00:02:01,162
For my health I'd like to walk more and eat fewer sweets.

22
00:02:02,067 --> 00:02:12,731
Great! Practise topic 18 on the Zkouška A2 nanečisto website, the link is in the video description. And subscribe — a new video every day.
